// SourceMode selects how the node acquires the Vrooli source it builds from.
// PINNED_REVISION (the default, fleet-safe path) has the node git-clone/fetch a
// pushed commit, so its provenance is an exact, fetchable revision. WORKING_TREE
// is the owner development/validation path: the control plane ships its LOCAL
// working tree (tracked + modified + untracked-non-ignored files) to the node
// over the established SSH channel, so uncommitted work onboards without a commit
// or push — at the cost of honest "dirty" provenance (the node is pinned to no
